sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Legitimate as Legitimate Client
    actor Attacker as Attacker (Stolen RT)
    participant Ctrl as Controller
    participant Svc as Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as Database
    Note over Legitimate, DB: Bước 1: Kẻ tấn công sử dụng RT_1 (đã dùng) gửi yêu cầu refresh
    Attacker->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (Body: {"refreshTokenStr": "RT_1"})
    Ctrl->>Svc: refreshToken(RefreshTokenRequest)
    Svc->>Repo: tokenRepos.findWithUserByRefreshTokenStr(RT_1)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM tokens WHERE refresh_token_str = RT_1
    DB-->>Repo: Token record (used = true)
    Repo-->>Svc: Token entity (with User details)
    Note over Legitimate, DB: Bước 2: Phát hiện REUSE (RT_1 đã từng được sử dụng trước đó)
    Svc->>Repo: tokenRepos.deleteByUserUsername(username)
    Repo->>DB: DELETE FROM tokens WHERE username = username
    DB-->>Repo: Confirmation
    Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw SecurityException
    Ctrl-->>Attacker: 403 Forbidden (Access Denied)
    Note over Legitimate, DB: Bước 3: Người dùng hợp lệ dùng RT_2 (mới nhất) để refresh
    Legitimate->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (Body: {"refreshTokenStr": "RT_2"})
    Ctrl->>Svc: refreshToken(RefreshTokenRequest)
    Svc->>Repo: tokenRepos.findWithUserByRefreshTokenStr(RT_2)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM tokens WHERE refresh_token_str = RT_2
    DB-->>Repo: Empty (Đã bị xóa ở Bước 2)
    Repo-->>Svc: Optional.empty()
    Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw TokenNotFoundException
    Ctrl-->>Legitimate: 404 Not Found (Yêu cầu đăng nhập lại)